          "text": "Témoignages: CHAMBERY (73) 06.07.2015",
          "text_sha256": "52f69dd95b1ccb2ee9d2c863a7f456f957ee4fb5d2213b2616248591fa74e772"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
